ath d="M17.6464 29.6464C17.4512 29.8417 17.4512 30.1583 17.6464 30.3536L20.8284 33.5355C21.0237 33.7308 21.3403 33.7308 21.5355 33.5355C21.7308 33.3403 21.7308 33.0237 21.5355 32.8284L18.7071 30L21.5355 27.1716C21.7308 26.9763 21.7308 26.6597 21.5355 26.4645C21.3403 26.2692 21.0237 26.2692 20.8284 26.4645L17.6464 29.6464ZM43 29.5L18 29.5V30.5L43 30.5V29.5Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><button class="project-swiper-button-next position-relative" aria-label="Next"><svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.75" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 60 0)" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.5"></circle><path d="M42.3536 29.6464C42.5488 29.8417 42.5488 30.1583 42.3536 30.3536L39.1716 33.5355C38.9763 33.7308 38.6597 33.7308 38.4645 33.5355C38.2692 33.3403 38.2692 33.0237 38.4645 32.8284L41.2929 30L38.4645 27.1716C38.2692 26.9763 38.2692 26.6597 38.4645 26.4645C38.6597 26.2692 38.9763 26.2692 39.1716 26.4645L42.3536 29.6464ZM17 29.5L42 29.5V30.5L17 30.5V29.5Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-section="Sustainability"><section class=" position-relative overflow-hidden "><div class="container"><div class="gx-lg-5 align-items-center rev-col row"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="head_wrap"><a href="/sustainability"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title  " data-splitting="">Sustainable Luxury, Built for the Future </h3></div></a></div><div class="contentwrap"><p><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#000000;">At Puravankara, </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:hsl(0,0%,0%);">sustainability </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#000000;">isn’t just a commitment, it’s a way of life. We seamlessly blend eco-conscious design with luxurious living, ensuring every home is crafted with energy-efficient materials, advanced water conservation systems, and effective waste management solutions. Our thoughtfully designed landscapes feature native plants, rainwater harvesting, and expansive green spaces, fostering a deep connection with nature.</span></p><p><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#000000;">With energy efficiency at the core of our developments, we actively minimize our carbon footprint and integrate eco-friendly practices across all projects. By prioritizing sustainable innovation, Puravankara is shaping a greener tomorrow, one home at a time.</span></p></div><div class="btnwrap"><a href="/sustainability" class="flat_btn">Know More</a></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="imgwrap mt-4 mt-md-0 position-relative" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(40px)"><div class="rotatebox featanimbox"></div><div class="sustainimg mb-4"><img alt="sustainability image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="img-fluid position-relative object-fit-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=70 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=70 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=70 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=70 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=70 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=70 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_16e3dac6e1_c5ad9ee998.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=70"/></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-section="Testimonials"><section class="sec-padd  testimonials pt-0"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-8"><div cl