rg","telephone":"+91-80-4343-9999","openingHours":"Mo-Fr 09:00-18:00"},"schemaName":"RealEstateAgent"},{"id":521,"jsonSchema":{"@id":"https://www.puravankara.com/#website","url":"https://www.puravankara.com/","name":"Puravankara","@type":"WebSite","@context":"https://schema.org","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.puravankara.com/#organization"},"potentialAction":{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://www.puravankara.com/search?q={search_term_string}"},"query-input":"required name=search_term_string"}},"schemaName":"WebSite Schema"},{"id":522,"jsonSchema":{"@id":"https://www.puravankara.com/","geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":"12.975","longitude":"77.620"},"url":"https://www.puravankara.com/","name":"Puravankara Limited","@type":"LocalBusiness","image":"https://www.puravankara.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpurvankara-logo.svg\u0026w=256\u0026q=75","sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/puravankara","https://www.instagram.com/puravankara_official/","https://www.linkedin.com/company/puravankara"],"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","postalCode":"560042","addressRegion":"Karnataka","streetAddress":"130/1 Ulsoor Road","addressCountry":"IN","addressLocality":"Bengaluru"},"@context":"https://schema.org","telephone":"+91-80-44555555","priceRange":"₹₹₹","openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","opens":"09:00","closes":"18:00","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday"]}]},"schemaName":"LocalBusiness Schema"},{"id":684,"jsonSchema":{"@id":"https://www.puravankara.com/#webpage","url":"https://www.puravankara.com/","name":"Puravankara | Top Builders in Bangalore | Real Estate Developer","@type":"WebPage","about":{"@id":"https://www.puravankara.com/#organization","@type":"Organization"},"@context":"https://schema.org","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.puravankara.com/#website","@type":"WebSite"},"inLanguage":"en-IN","description":"Explore premium residential apartments, villas, plotted developments, and commercial properties by Puravankara across India's leading cities.","dateModified":"2026-07-29","datePublished":"1975-01-01","potentialAction":{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://www.puravankara.com/"]},"primaryImageOfPage":{"url":"https://www.puravankara.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpurvankara-logo.svg\u0026w=256\u0026q=75","@type":"ImageObject"}},"schemaName":"Schema"},{"id":685,"jsonSchema":{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@context":"https://schema.org","itemListElement":[{"item":"https://www.puravankara.com/","name":"Home","@type":"ListItem","position":1},{"item":"https://www.puravankara.com/projects/","name":"Projects","@type":"ListItem","position":2}]},"schemaName":"BreadcrumbList"},{"id":747,"jsonSchema":{"@type":"FAQPage","@context":"https://schema.org","mainEntity":[{"name":"Which is the best real estate company in Bangalore?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara is widely recognized as one of the best real estate companies in Bangalore, with a legacy dating back to 1975. The company has developed premium residential communities known for quality construction, innovative design, and customer-centric planning. With projects across prime locations in Bengaluru and other major Indian cities, Puravankara focuses on sustainable development, timely delivery, and modern amenities. Homebuyers looking for luxury apartments, premium homes, or investment opportunities can explore a diverse portfolio backed by decades of expertise and trust.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Who are the top builders in Bangalore for premium residential projects?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Among the top builders in Bangalore, Puravankara has earned a strong reputation for delivering thoughtfully designed residential developments. With nearly five decades of experience, the company offers luxury apartments, premium residences, and integrated communities across key locations in Bengaluru. Every project is planned with quality construction, smart layouts, lifestyle amenities, green spaces, and excellent connectivity, making Puravankara a preferred choice for families, professionals, and investors seeking long-term value.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Why should I invest in real estate in Bangalore?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Real estate in Bangalore continues to attract homebuyers and investors because of the city's growing IT sector, infrastructure development, employment opportunities, and strong housing demand. Bengaluru offers excellent appreciation potential across established and emerging locations. Choosing an experienced developer like Puravankara provides buyers with quality construction, premium amenities, strategic project locations, and trusted customer service, making it easier to invest confidently in one of India's most dynamic property markets.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"What makes Puravankara one of the best builders in Bangalore?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara stands out among the best builders in Bangalore because of its commitment to quality, innovation, customer satisfaction, and transparent business practices. Established in 1975, the company has successfully delivered landmark residential and commercial developments across India. Buyers benefit from thoughtfully planned communities, premium specifications, sustainable features, advanced construction technologies, and a strong focus on creating homes that offer long-term comfort and value.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Which are the top real estate companies in India?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"India is home to several reputed real estate developers, and Puravankara is recognized among the top real estate companies in India. Headquartered in Bengaluru, the company has expanded across multiple cities while maintaining high standards of construction, design, and customer experience. Its portfolio includes luxury residences, premium apartments, plotted developments, commercial spaces, and sustainable communities designed to meet evolving lifestyle needs.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Why choose experienced real estate developers in India?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Experienced real estate developers in India offer greater confidence through proven project execution, quality construction, legal transparency, and reliable customer support. Puravankara brings nearly five decades of industry expertise, delivering homes that meet high standards of engineering and design. Buyers benefit from trusted processes, modern amenities, premium locations, and a strong focus on customer satisfaction throughout the home-buying journey.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Which are the best residential projects in Bangalore?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"The best residential projects in Bangalore are those that combine excellent location, quality construction, lifestyle amenities, and long-term appreciation potential. Puravankara offers a diverse portfolio of luxury apartments, premium residences, and integrated communities across Bengaluru. These developments feature spacious homes, green landscapes, recreational facilities, advanced security, and convenient access to workplaces, schools, healthcare, and entertainment hubs.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"What types of homes does Puravankara offer?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara offers a wide range of residential options including luxury apartments, premium residences, villas, and plotted developments across major Indian cities. Homebuyers can choose from thoughtfully designed configurations that suit families, professionals, first-time buyers, and investors. Every home is built with attention to quality, functionality, aesthetics, and long-term comfort while incorporating modern lifestyle features and sustainable design principles.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"How does Puravankara support sustainable living?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara integrates sustainability into its developments through energy-efficient planning, water conservation systems, rainwater harvesting, waste management practices, landscaped green spaces, and environmentally responsible construction methods. These initiatives help create healthier communities while reducing environmental impact. Buyers benefit from comfortable, future-ready homes that balance luxury living with sustainable development principles.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Why should I choose Puravankara for my next home?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Choosing Puravankara means investing with one of India's most trusted real estate developers. With nearly five decades of expertise, the company has consistently delivered premium residential communities that combine innovative architecture, quality construction, sustainable design, and customer-focused experiences. Whether you are buying your first home, upgrading to a luxury residence, or investing in Bangalore real estate, Puravankara offers thoughtfully designed homes that deliver comfort, convenience, and lasting value.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"What amenities can I expect in Puravankara residential projects?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara residential projects are designed to provide a comfortable and modern lifestyle with amenities such as clubhouses, swimming pools, fitness centres, landscaped gardens, children's play areas, jogging tracks, indoor games, sports courts, multipurpose halls, and round-the-clock security. Many communities also include green spaces, walking paths, and wellness facilities that promote healthy living. The amenities are planned to enhance convenience, recreation, and the overall living experience for residents.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"What makes Puravankara projects a good investment?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara projects are located in high-growth residential destinations with strong infrastructure and connectivity, making them attractive for both end-users and investors. The company's reputation for quality construction and premium developments adds long-term value to every property. Homebuyers also benefit from modern amenities, desirable locations, and thoughtfully planned communities that support lifestyle needs while offering the potential for appreciation as surrounding infrastructure continues to develop.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"How does Puravankara maintain construction quality?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Puravankara follows rigorous quality standards throughout every stage of project development, from planning and engineering to construction and final delivery. The company uses modern construction practices, premium materials, and experienced professionals to ensure durability, safety, and design excellence. Regular quality checks and attention to detail help create homes that meet customer expectations while maintaining consistency across residential developments in Bangalore and other major Indian cities.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"How can I book a home with Puravankara?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Booking a home with Puravankara is simple. You can explore residential projects on the official website, compare locations, floor plans, amenities, and pricing, and submit an enquiry for expert assistance. The sales team helps you understand project details, site visits, payment plans, and the booking process. Whether you are searching for your first home, a luxury residence, or an investment property, Puravankara provides guidance throughout your home-buying journey.","@type":"Answer"}}]},"schemaName":"FAQ Schema"}],"metaSocial":[],"metaImage":{"data":{"id":10896,"attributes":{"name":"WEbsite banner_opt2.jpg","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":1920,"height":1080,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/large_WEbsite_banner_opt2.jpg","hash":"large_WEbsite_banner_opt2","mim